      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Logyard Overview\n\nLogyard is the homelab log search and live-tail surface backed by Loki.\n\n**Use this dashboard for the first look. Use Grafana Explore for deep filtering and ad-hoc search.**\n\nDashboard filters:\n- `host` narrows the current producer host\n- `service` narrows systemd/syslog services within the selected host\n- `level` narrows the current log stream and line counters without replacing the dedicated error panels\n\nStarter LogQL queries:\n\n```logql\n{source_type=\"journald\", host=~\"$host\", service=~\"$service\", level=~\"$level\"}\n```\n\n```logql\n{source_type=\"journald\", host=~\"$host\", service=~\"$service\"} |= \"error\"\n```\n\n```logql\n{source_type=\"journald\", host=~\"$host\", service=~\"$service\", level=~\"error|critical|alert|emerg\"}\n```\n\nScope decisions:\n- retention: **14 days**\n- source scope: **journald first**\n- indexed labels: **host, service, source_type, environment, level**",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.4.0",
      "title": "Operator Notes",
      "type": "text"
    },
